<title>PAKISTAN: Port conditions update - Pakistan - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Pakistan - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>PAKISTAN, Feb 20 - Karachi - 20 Vessels waiting off port, comprising one general cargo waiting three days, four containers waiting up to two days, eight fertiliser waiting up to 44 days, six loaders waiting up to 20 days, one oil tanker waiting two days. Five other vessels waiting off port for their own reasons.</p>
</text>
